    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3170\"><em data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3170\">(18th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3266\">You undertake a scene-long ritual capable of altering a place, hex, or community meaningfully.</p><p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3287\">This is not damage.</p><p data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3312\">This is transformation.</p><p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3323\">Examples:</p><ul data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3509\"><li data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3377\"><p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3377\">Rewriting the ambient correspondence of a location.</p></li><li data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3413\"><p data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3413\">Stabilizing a corrupted district.</p></li><li data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3459\"><p data-start=\"3416\" data-end=\"3459\">Rebalancing a fractured symbolic structure.</p></li><li data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3509\"><p data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3509\">Shifting the long-term identity of a community.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3519\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3533\">Once per arc.</p><p data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3572\">Strain applies. Backlash is possible.</p><p data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3630\">But when completed properly, the world does not explode.</p><p data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3667\">It changes quietly—and permanently.</p><p data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3706\"></p>",
